    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d492">

                <pb facs="0451" n="335" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg335"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/761.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Smith to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 23, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>National Bank of Haiti, as creditor of the Government, protests to this Legation
                    against the seizure of the custom house at Cape Haitien by rebels, and requests
                    the “exercise of such influence as is possible to protect said creditors”</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
